      "content": "It's completely understandable that you feel overwhelmed; the sheer weight of the world's problems is crushing. Acknowledging that the future is uncertain is a valid response to such a bleak reality. Perhaps instead of trying to fix everything, you could focus on finding a small, immediate way to make the present moment feel less heavy. Sometimes, the most profound act of defiance against despair is simply choosing to be present in a way that feels meaningful to you right now.",
